    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '"Nothing we do matters in the end, and that is precisely why we are not shackled by the burden of expectations, the fear of eternal judgement or the failure to meet up to an arbitrary definition of what makes our limited time ''not wasted''."'
--- !u!114 &21686
