    m_Alignment: 4
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '"Why not? If we''re stuck in here together anyway, what''s the point of making it worse for both of us?"'
--- !u!114 &21698
