    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.5
  m_Text: '"Say... We''re already way too late for school and it''s become quite clear by now that nobody''s going to come lead us there, so how about you and I ditch that passion-draining penitentiary and go grab something to eat, eh?" ▼'
